            "Now in board book-a colorful journey with dinosaurs of every shape and size! This colorful parade of dinosaurs is a vibrant, visual feast for very young fans of prehistoric creatures. The simple text and bold illustrations are ideal for preschoolers who are fascinated with these magnificent animals. Some dinosaurs are tall. Some dinosaurs are very small. Some dinosaurs walk on two legs, others on four. And some dinosaurs look sweet while others look scary. Preschoolers meet twelve dinosaurs (all identified) ranging the gamut from big to small, meat eaters to plant eaters, as well as special facts about each. Now in board book for the youngest dinosaur enthusiasts!"
